# The Empty Place
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
I miss my father most when something good happens.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
I still remember what I promised him.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
I know. But I did not ask you to spend your life repaying a dead man.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
I am not here only because of him.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Then someday, tell me why you stayed.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
Her hand rests near yours, close enough to choose.
